invariant: INV-33
file: webpki.c
catches: webpki_auth_test
reason: under pins alone the list framing holds every entry after the
  leaf to the walk's CH_WEBPKI_CERT_MAX, though it stores none of them
  and a Certificate message carries an entry up to
  CH_WEBPKI_LEAF_PIN_CERT_MAX. A server whose chain carries a large
  certificate after its pinned leaf fails with bad_certificate.
  test/webpki_leaf_pins.h's rows with the corpus leaf over
  CH_WEBPKI_CERT_MAX after the r2 leaf, which want it accepted, object.

--- old
        rc = webpki_read_entry(&r, CH_WEBPKI_LEAF_PIN_CERT_MAX, &cert, &cert_len, alert);
--- new
        rc = webpki_read_entry(&r, CH_WEBPKI_CERT_MAX, &cert, &cert_len, alert);
